2"><span class="jsx-55f3662846dfaca2 ds-dot"></span>Repo access</li><li style="--ds-i:1" class="jsx-55f3662846dfaca2"><span class="jsx-55f3662846dfaca2 ds-dot"></span>The design files</li><li style="--ds-i:2" class="jsx-55f3662846dfaca2"><span class="jsx-55f3662846dfaca2 ds-dot"></span>A staging key</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="jsx-55f3662846dfaca2 ds-pill"><span aria-hidden="true" class="jsx-55f3662846dfaca2 ds-pill-frost"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="jsx-55f3662846dfaca2 ds-pill-edge"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="jsx-55f3662846dfaca2 ds-wave"><div class="ph-no-capture" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:100%"><div style="width:4px;height:3.5px;margin:0 2.5px;border-radius:50%;background:rgb(128, 128, 128);flex-shrink:0;transition:height 60ms linear, background 80ms linear;will-change:height, background"></div><div style="width:4px;height:3.5px;margin:0 2.5px;border-radius:50%;background:rgb(128, 128, 128);flex-shrink:0;transition:height 60ms linear, background 80ms linear;will-change:height, background"></div><div style="width:4px;height:3.5px;margin:0 2.5px;border-radius:50%;background:rgb(128, 128, 128);flex-shrink:0;transition:height 60ms linear, background 80ms linear;will-change:height, background"></div><div style="width:4px;height:3.5px;margin:0 2.5px;border-radius:50%;background:rgb(128, 128, 128);flex-shrink:0;transition:height 60ms linear, background 80ms linear;will-change:height, background"></div><div style="width:4px;height:3.5px;margin:0 2.5px;border-radius:50%;background:rgb(128, 128, 128);flex-shrink:0;transition:height 60ms linear, background 80ms linear;will-change:height, background"></div></div></span></div></div></div><p class="jsx-55f3662846dfaca2 sr-only">I&#x27;m getting started with the project. There are three things I need: repo access, the design files, and a staging key.</p></div></section><section id="dictation-edits" class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce relative overflow-hidden px-4 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24"><div class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce relative mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-1 items-center gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-12"><div class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce order-1 text-center lg:text-left"><h2 class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-head section-title text-4xl font-normal tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">Say it messy, <span style="font-weight:600">it lands clean</span></h2><p class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500 md:text-xl lg:mx-0">Speak the way you actually think. VoiceOS drops the filler, fixes the spelling, learns the names you use, and writes down what you meant.</p></div><div class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce order-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-lg lg:max-w-none"><div class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-card"><div class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-stage"><p class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-raw"><span class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-anno dc-anno-filler"><span class="dc-struck "><span class="dc-struck-text"><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:0">so</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:1"> u</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:2">m</span></span><svg class="dc-pen" viewBox="0 0 100 20" preserveAspectRatio="none" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path class="dc-pen-stroke dc-pen-main" d="M-1.5 12.2 C 14 11.4, 32 10.95, 50 10.75 C 68 10.55, 84 10.15, 94 9.35 C 97 9.05, 99 8.9, 101.5 8.5" pathLength="1"></path><path class="dc-pen-stroke dc-pen-back" d="M96 9.2 C 82 10.2, 66 10.75, 48 11.15 C 33 11.5, 17 12.25, 3.5 12.8" pathLength="1"></path></svg><svg class="dc-spark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path class="dc-spark-stroke" d="M9 16.5 Q9.4 11.5 10.5 7" pathLength="1"></path><path class="dc-spark-stroke" d="M12 17 Q14.8 13 17.5 9.5" pathLength="1"></path><path class="dc-spark-stroke" d="M14 18.5 Q17.5 16.5 21 15" pathLength="1"></path></svg></span><span class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-tag">Removed filler</span></span><span class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce"><span class="d