s="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:109">es</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:110">s</span><svg class="dc-squiggle" viewBox="0 0 100 10" preserveAspectRatio="none" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 7 Q 6.25 1, 12.5 7 T 25 7 T 37.5 7 T 50 7 T 62.5 7 T 75 7 T 87.5 7 T 100 7" pathLength="1"></path></svg></span><span class="dc-now" aria-hidden="true">Postgres</span></span><span class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-tag">Fixed spelling</span></span><span class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce"><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:110.5"> l</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:111.5">og</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:112.5">s </span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:113.5">ar</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:114.5">e </span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:115.5">fu</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:116.5">ll</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:117.5"> o</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:118.5">f </span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:119.5">ti</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:120.5">me</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:121.5">ou</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:122.5">ts</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:123.5">, </span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:124.5">so</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:125.5"> l</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:126.5">et</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:127.5">&#x27;s</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:128.5"> m</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:129.5">ov</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:130.5">e </span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:131.5">st</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:132.5">an</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:133.5">du</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:134.5">p </span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:135.5">to</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:136.5"> t</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:137.5">en</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:138.5">.</span></span></p><div style="--dc-at:2960ms;--dc-step:3ms;--dc-caret-at:3332ms;--dc-send-at:3572ms" class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-out"><div class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-out-text"><span class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce sr-only">Can you take a look at the onboarding bug on the mobile app? Three separate things are going wrong with it: Priya&#x27;s fix from last night did not take. The magic link still lands in spam. The Postgres logs are full of timeouts. Let&#x27;s move standup to ten.</span><p aria-hidden="true" class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-out-line"><span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:0">Ca</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:1">n </span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:2">yo</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:3">u </span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:4">ta</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:5">ke</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:6"> a</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:7"> l</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:8">oo</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:9">k </span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:10">at</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:11"> t</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:12">he</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:13"> o</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:14">nb</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:15">oa</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:16">rd</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:17">in</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:18">g </span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:19">bu</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:20">g </span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:21">on</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:22"> t</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:23">he</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:24"> m</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:25">ob</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:26">il</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:27">e </span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:28">ap</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:29">p?</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:30"> T</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:31">hr</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:32">ee</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:33"> s</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:34">ep</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:35">ar</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:36">at</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:37">e </span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:38">th</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:39">in</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:40">gs</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:41"> a</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:42">re</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:43"> g</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:44">oi</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:45">ng</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:46"> w</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:47">ro</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:48">ng</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:49"> w</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:50">it</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:51">h </span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:52">it</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:53">:</span></span></p><ul aria-hidden="true" class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-out-list"><li style="--dc-i:53.5" class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce"><span class="dc-kept"><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:53.5">Pr</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:54.5">iy</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:55.5">a</span></span><span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:56">&#x27;s</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:57"> f</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:58">ix</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:59"> f</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:60">ro</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:61">m </span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:62">la</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:63">st</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:64"> n</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:65">ig</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:66">ht</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:67"> d</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:68">id</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:69"> n</span><span class