 class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:107.5">me</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:108.5">ou</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:109.5">ts</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:110.5">.</span></span></li></ul><p aria-hidden="true" class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-out-line"><span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:111">Le</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:112">t&#x27;</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:113">s </span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:114">mo</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:115">ve</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:116"> s</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:117">ta</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:118">nd</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:119">up</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:120"> t</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:121">o </span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:122">te</span><span class="dc-ch" style="--dc-i:123">n.</span></span><span class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-caret"></span></p></div><div class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-out-bar"><span aria-hidden="true" class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-out-tools"><span class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-tool dc-tool-b">B</span><span class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-tool dc-tool-i">I</span><span class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-tool dc-tool-u">U</span><span class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-tool-rule"></span><span class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-tool"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 6h.01M4 12h.01M4 18h.01M8.5 6H20M8.5 12H20M8.5 18H20" class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce"></path></svg></span><span class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-tool"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.5 13.5a4 4 0 0 0 5.66 0l2.5-2.5a4 4 0 1 0-5.66-5.66l-1.2 1.2M13.5 10.5a4 4 0 0 0-5.66 0l-2.5 2.5a4 4 0 1 0 5.66 5.66l1.2-1.2" class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce"></path></svg></span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce dc-out-send"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" class="jsx-89dd6bb02474a4ce"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="dictation-tone" class="jsx-e959ac0e499733a3 relative overflow-hidden px-4 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24"><div class="jsx-e959ac0e499733a3 relative mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-1 items-center gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-14"><div class="jsx-e959ac0e499733a3 order-1 text-center lg:order-2 lg:text-left"><h2 class="jsx-e959ac0e499733a3 ts-head section-title text-4xl font-normal tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">It writes to fit <span style="font-weight:600">where it lands</span></h2><p class="jsx-e959ac0e499733a3 mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500 md:text-xl lg:mx-0">Say it once. VoiceOS reads the app your cursor is in and writes to match, so the same thought arrives as a proper email, a quick text, or a clean list of notes.</p></div><div class="jsx-e959ac0e499733a3 order-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-lg lg:order-1 lg:max-w-none"><div class="jsx-e959ac0e499733a3 ts-card"><div class="ts-sheet ts-sheet-mail" style="--ts-i:0"><div class="ts-sheet-head"><img src="/icons/newMail.png" alt="Mail app icon" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" class="ts-icon"/><span class="ts-sheet-name">Mail</span></div><div class="ts-sheet-body"><p class="jsx-e959ac0e499733a3 ts-line">Hi John,</p><p class="jsx-e959ac0e499733a3 ts-line ts-line-gap">I&#x27;ll send the deck over tonight.</p><p class="jsx-e959ac0e499733a3 ts-line ts-line-gap">Best,<br class="jsx-e959ac0e499733a3"/>Steve</p></div></div><div class="ts-sheet ts-sheet-messages" style="--ts-i:1"><div class="ts-sheet-head"><img src="/icons/imessageApp.webp" alt="Messages app icon" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" class="ts-icon"/><span class="ts-sheet-name">Messages</span></div><div class="ts-sheet-body"><p class="jsx-e959ac0e499733a3 ts-bubble">sending the deck tonight</p></div></div><div class="ts-sheet ts-sheet-notion" style="--ts-i:2"><div class="ts-sheet-head"><img src="/icons/notionApp.webp" alt="Notion app icon" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" class="ts-icon"/><span class="ts-sheet-name">Notion</span></div><div class="ts-sheet-body"><p class="jsx-e959ac0e499733a3 ts-page-title">Today</p><ul class="jsx-e959ac0e499733a3 ts-list"><li class="jsx-e959ac0e499733a3 ts-list-item">Send John the deck tonight</li><li class="jsx-e959ac0e499733a3 ts-list-item">Add the Q3 numbers to slide four</li><li class="jsx-e959ac0e499733a3 ts-list-item">Ask Priya for the revenue <span class="ts-caret-hold">chart<span class="ts-caret" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="dictation-spelling" class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 relative overflow-hidden px-4 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24"><div class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 relative mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-1 items-center gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-14"><div class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 order-1 text-center lg:text-left"><h2 class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 sp-head section-title text-4xl font-normal tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">It spells them <span style="font-weight:600">your way</span></h2><p class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500 md:text-xl lg:mx-0">Names, products, acronyms. Say them however they come out and VoiceOS writes them the way you write them.</p></div><div class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 order-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-lg lg:max-w-none"><div class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 sp-card"><div class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 sp-pill"><span aria-hidden="true" class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 sp-pill-frost"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 sp-pill-edge"></span><span class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 sp-pill-inner"><span ari