874c5e3c69 sp-said">“wako AI”</span></span></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 sp-drop"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 5v14M6 13l6 6 6-6" class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69"></path></svg></span><p class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 sp-wrote"><span aria-hidden="true" class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69"><span style="animation-delay:420ms" class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 sp-char">W</span><span style="animation-delay:465ms" class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 sp-char">a</span><span style="animation-delay:510ms" class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 sp-char">k</span><span style="animation-delay:555ms" class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 sp-char">o</span><span style="animation-delay:600ms" class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 sp-char">A</span><span style="animation-delay:645ms" class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 sp-char">I</span></span><span class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 sr-only">WakoAI</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="jsx-ab307874c5e3c69 sp-rule"></span></p></div></div></div></section><section id="dictation-languages" class="jsx-e2a6f3e6774648a5 relative pb-14 pt-10 md:pb-20 md:pt-16"><div class="jsx-e2a6f3e6774648a5 lg-card"><div class="jsx-e2a6f3e6774648a5 lg-inner"><div class="jsx-e2a6f3e6774648a5 lg-copy"><h2 class="jsx-e2a6f3e6774648a5 lg-head section-title">Speak the <span class="lg-word">language<span class="lg-stage" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lg-planet"><span class="lg-face">🌍</span></span><span class="lg-spark" style="--x:-0.8em;--y:-4.0em;--r:-16deg;--d:300ms">あ</span><span class="lg-spark" style="--x:4.8em;--y:-2.4em;--r:18deg;--d:380ms">한</span><span class="lg-spark" style="--x:1.2em;--y:-4.8em;--r:-10deg;--d:460ms">ñ</span><span class="lg-spark" style="--x:5.6em;--y:0.3em;--r:26deg;--d:340ms">Ж</span><span class="lg-spark" style="--x:3.0em;--y:-4.0em;--r:-12deg;--d:420ms">ع</span><span class="lg-spark" style="--x:5.9em;--y:-1.2em;--r:14deg;--d:500ms">ह</span></span></span> you <span style="font-weight:600">think in</span></h2><p class="jsx-e2a6f3e6774648a5 lg-sub">Over 100 languages. Nothing to switch, nothing to set.</p></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="jsx-e2a6f3e6774648a5 lg-art"><div class="jsx-e2a6f3e6774648a5 lg-sheet"><span style="--i:1" class="jsx-e2a6f3e6774648a5 lg-pick"><span class="jsx-e2a6f3e6774648a5 lg-wave"><div class="ph-no-capture" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:100%"><div style="width:3px;height:3px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:50%;background:rgb(205, 205, 205);flex-shrink:0;transition:height 60ms linear, background 80ms linear;will-change:height, background"></div><div style="width:3px;height:3px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:50%;background:rgb(205, 205, 205);flex-shrink:0;transition:height 60ms linear, background 80ms linear;will-change:height, background"></div><div style="width:3px;height:3px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:50%;background:rgb(205, 205, 205);flex-shrink:0;transition:height 60ms linear, background 80ms linear;will-change:height, background"></div><div style="width:3px;height:3px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:50%;background:rgb(205, 205, 205);flex-shrink:0;transition:height 60ms linear, background 80ms linear;will-change:height, background"></div><div style="width:3px;height:3px;margin:0 2px;border-radius:50%;background:rgb(205, 205, 205);flex-shrink:0;transition:height 60ms linear, background 80ms linear;will-change:height, background"></div></div></span></span><ul class="jsx-e2a6f3e6774648a5 lg-list"><li dir="auto" class="jsx-e2a6f3e6774648a5 lg-row">Português</li><li dir="auto" class="jsx-e2a6f3e6774648a5 lg-row is-on">English</li><li dir="auto" class="jsx-e2a6f3e6774648a5 lg-row">日本語</li><li dir="auto" class="jsx-e2a6f3e6774648a5 lg-row">Español</li><li dir="auto" class="jsx-e2a6f3e6774648a5 lg-row">Français</li><li dir="auto" class="jsx-e2a6f3e6774648a5 lg-row">Deutsch</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative px-4 py-24 md:px-8 md:py-32 b